      "title": "Who Are You?",
      "desc": "The access point asks for an identity",
      "detail": "The laptop has joined “Office”, a WPA2-Enterprise network, but until it has logged in the access point passes on nothing except login messages. It asks who the laptop is with an EAP Identity request, and the laptop answers alex@example.org. The access point knows no accounts: it will pass the answer on to the RADIUS server.",
