    {
      "title": "Ask RADIUS",
      "desc": "The login goes to the server",
      "detail": "The access point copies the EAP message into a RADIUS Access-Request and sends it to the RADIUS server on UDP port 1812, with the laptop’s MAC address and the network’s name. A secret that only the two of them share protects every packet. The server answers with an Access-Challenge: the next message for the laptop, which is “start EAP-TLS”.",
