    {
      "title": "Access-Accept",
      "desc": "And a key for the access point",
      "detail": "The server answers Access-Accept. Inside are EAP Success for the laptop; the first 32 bytes of the key material for the access point, encrypted with the shared secret (MS-MPPE-Recv-Key); and VLAN 20, so this user lands on the staff network. The same access point could put another user on another VLAN.",
